<title>ALBANIA: SOCCER-ALBANIA BEAT ARMENIA 3-2 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ALBANIA BEAT ARMENIA 3-2 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>TIRANA 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Albania beat Armenia 3-2 (halftime</p>
<p>2-1) in a European under-21 soccer championship group nine</p>
<p>qualifier on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Albania - Eldorado Markoci (10), Ardian Dashi (39), Ervin</p>
<p>Fakaj (79)</p>
<p>Armenia - Eric Hayrapetyan (25), Ararat Harutyunyan (86)</p>
<p>Attendance: 3,000</p>
</text>
